Serious spoiler, learned in discovery mode:





the object of the game is to sacrifice the Amulet on
the endgame level to your god. I advise wearing a ring
of conflict, dropping the Amulet to cast spells,
there is a room full of liches, another of trolls,
Dragons, Ogres and other uglies on Level 0.  stethoscope is useful
to detect the secret doors between these rooms since they
have hard walls (and floors)  No bamfing either except
with teleport scrolls.  Not cursed level teleporters either.

Oh yeah, The Wizard ignores Elbereth's.


